<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Capital strategy, public-market readiness, corporate transformation, and long-term value creation."><title>Investor & IPO Center | ASAS</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body><div class="topbar"><div class="wrap"><span>One Vision. Every Sector. Lasting Value.</span><span>Rencana Induk 2026–2042+</span></div></div><header><div class="wrap navrow"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="brandmark"><b>A</b></span><span class="brandtext"><b>ASAS</b><small>STRATEGIC ASSET SOLUTIONS</small></span></a><button class="hamb" type="button">MENU</button><nav class="nav"><a class="" href="index.html">Beranda</a><a class="" href="about.html">Tentang</a><a class="" href="business.html">Bisnis</a><a class="" href="leadership.html">Kepemimpinan</a><a class="" href="roadmap.html">Roadmap</a><a class="" href="global.html">Global</a><a class="active" href="investor.html">Investor</a><a class="" href="technology.html">Teknologi</a><a class="" href="blockchain.html">Blockchain</a><a class="" href="governance.html">Tata Kelola</a><a class="cta" href="investor.html">Perspektif Investor</a></nav></div></header><section class="pagehero"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">ASAS CORPORATE</div><h1>Investor & IPO Center</h1><p>Capital strategy, public-market readiness, corporate transformation, and long-term value creation.</p></div></section><section class="section "><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">ASAS INSIGHT</div><h2>Target IPO 2029.</h2></div><p>The equity story combines integrated assets, recurring revenue, governance, digital trust, and ASEAN growth.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="num">01</div><h3>IPO Readiness</h3><p>Audit, corporate secretary, internal audit, prospectus, due diligence, and market governance.</p><a href="governance.html">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Use of Proceeds</h3><p>Property and airports, acquisitions, technology and data, working capital and talent.</p><a href="business.html">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="num">03</div><h3>Corporate Transformation</h3><p>PT ASAS → ASAS Inc. → ASAS Group Global → Global World.</p><a href="roadmap.html">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><div class="kicker">ASAS INSIGHT</div><h2>Corporate scorecard.</h2></div><p>Long-term targets provide direction and require validation through annual planning and audit.</p></div><div class="tablewrap"><table class="table"><tr><th>KPI</th><th>2029</th><th>2033</th><th>2041+</th></tr><tr><td>Revenue</td><td>Rp 1 T</td><td>Rp 30 T</td><td>Rp 60 T</td></tr><tr><td>EBITDA Margin</td><td>15%</td><td>25%</td><td>28%</td></tr><tr><td>Employees</td><td>1,500</td><td>50,000</td><td>50,000</td></tr><tr><td>Countries</td><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>ESG Score</td><td>50</td><td>75</td><td>85</td></tr></table></div></div></section><section class="footercta"><div class="wrap"><div><div class="kicker" style="color:#624800">BUILDING LASTING VALUE</div><h2>Jelajahi ekosistem ASAS.</h2></div><a class="btn btn-dark" href="business.html">Jelajahi Portofolio →</a></div></section><footer><div class="wrap"><div class="footgrid"><div><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark"><b>A</b></span><span class="brandtext"><b>ASAS</b><small>AGGREGATE STRATEGIC ASSET SOLUTIONS</small></span></div><p>An integrated strategic asset platform built from Banten for ASEAN and the world.</p></div><div><h4>Navigate</h4><a href="about.html">About ASAS</a><a href="leadership.html">Kepemimpinan</a><a href="roadmap.html">Strategic Roadmap</a><a href="global.html">Global Expansion</a></div><div><h4>Corporate</h4><a href="investor.html">Investor & IPO</a><